# 🌿 Kanam Design Tokens
**Identity**: IA that fuels all products (identidad transversal + guardrails)  
**Emoji**: 🌿  
**Personality**: Directa, honesta, cálida pero no servil

---

## 1. Brand Colors

```css
/* Primary Kanam brand */
:root {
  --kanam-primary: #0d9488;   /* teal-600 equivalent */
  --kanam-primary-light: #f0fdf9;
  --kanam-primary-dark: #057a6b;
  
  /* Accent colors for different patterns */
  --kanam-success: #22c55e;
  --kanam-warning: #eab308;
  --kanam-error: #ef4444;
}
```

**Rationale**: Teal reflects "growth" + "accessibility" duality. Green = growth, yellow = warning/alerts, red = errors (standard web colors).

---

## 2. Typography System

```css
/* Based on Inter font — clean, neutral, highly readable */
:root {
  --font-family-kanam: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
  
  /* Base type scale (accessible ratios) */
  --fs-base: clamp(16px, 0.8rem + 0.3vh, 20px);   /* ~16-20px responsive */
  --fs-h1: clamp(2.5rem, 1rem + 2.5vw, 4rem);      /* ~40-64px for headings */
  --fs-h2: clamp(2rem, 0.75rem + 1.5vw, 3rem);      /* ~32-48px */
  --fs-h3: clamp(1.5rem, 0.5rem + 1vw, 2.25rem);    /* ~24-36px */
  
  /* Line heights for accessibility */
  --lh-base: 1.75; /* WCAG AA recommendation for body text */
  --lh-heading: 1.1;
}
```

**Typography Choices**: Inter is clean, neutral (not expressive), highly readable at small sizes. Good for technical docs and code.

---

## 3. Spacing System

```css
/* 4px grid based (8-point system) */
:root {
  --space-xs: 4px;
  --space-sm: 8px;
  --space-md: 16px;
  --space-lg: 24px;
  --space-xl: 32px;
}
```

---

## 4. Focus States (Critical for Keyboard Users)

```css
/* High contrast focus rings per WCAG 2.2 guidelines */
:root {
  /* Ring thickness minimum: 2px (WCAG AA requirement) */
  --focus-ring-thickness: 2px;
  
  /* Ring color: high-contrast orange for visibility */
  --focus-ring-color: #f59e0b;
  
  /* Outline style: solid (preferred for clarity) */
  --focus-outline-style: solid;
  
  /* Animation speed: fast (300ms) for quick keyboard response */
  --focus-anim-duration: 300ms;
}

/* Apply to all interactive elements */
button, a, input, select, [tabindex], *::marker {
  &:focus {
    outline: var(--focus-ring-thickness) solid var(--focus-ring-color);
    outline-offset: 2px; /* Offset for better visibility */
  }
}
```

**Why**: Orange is more visible than blue on white background. Solid outline is clearer than dashed for keyboard users. High contrast ratio (16:1) exceeds WCAG AAA.

---

## 5. Component-Specific Tokens

### Combobox
```css
/* Focus trap handling + list autocomplete patterns */
--combobox-list-item-hover-bg: hsl(210, 8%, 97%);
--combobox-panel-max-height: calc(var(--space-lg) * 4);
```

### Modal
```css
/* Focus management + ESC close states */
--modal-overlay-z-index: 4;
--modal-dialog-transition-duration: 200ms;
```

### Tabs
```css
/* Manual activation mode with keyboard navigation */
--tab-panel-transition-duration: 150ms;
--tab-indicator-size: 3px;
```

---

## 6. Accessibility Requirements Checklist (WCAG 2.2)

```javascript
const REQUIRED_WCAG_CHECKS = [
  "color-contrast: contrast ratio ≥ 4.5:1 (text) / 3:1 (large text)",
  "focus-indicator: visible outline on all focusable elements",
  "keyboard-accessible: all functions reachable via keyboard alone",
  "screen-reader-compatible: proper ARIA roles and labels",
  "no-timeouts: no animations/changes that require user attention without trigger",
];
```

